+/* Reference recovery: the most anchors @dpb_slots DPB pictures hold. While a
+ * frame is coded the DPB holds the anchors, the chain picture, the picture
+ * being coded and, until anchors have overwritten all of its slots, the last
+ * key frame (it fills all eight VBI slots and the chain takes only one): K + 3
+ * pictures for K < 7, and 7 + 2 once seven anchors have replaced it. */
+guint
